<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Circuit City restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Circuit City restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Susan Quilty reinstated coverage of Circuit City Stores Inc-Circuit City Group with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- the stock was previously rated outperform.</p>
<p>-- coverage had been supended due to Morgan Stanley involvement in a deal with the company.</p>
<p>-- stock traded at 34-1/2 in early morning trade, flat with with Friday's close.</p>
</text>
